From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Oliver Sargison <sargo@sargo.cc>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 17:13:15 +1300
Subject: [PATCH 27/53] Plutonium: incognito tabs on the desktop

A desktop-rendered tab opened with profileId incognito asks for throwaway
storage of its own: the server's open command to the helper says incognito,
and the shell page creates its tab with createTab(url, tag, true). Neither
adopts a tab of the other kind, and a browser that can't open incognito tabs
fails the tab rather than showing shared storage as incognito.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
